      "writtenOn": "2024-03-13T10:11:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So apps which targeting V.\nWould be like:\nNR has LOCAL_NETWORK cap  | NC has LOCAL_NETWORK cap | matches\nF(default) | F | T\nF(default) | T | T\nT | F | F\nT | T | T\n\nIf so, my question is about the 2nd case:\nWhy do we want requests with default capabilities see local networks?\nDoes that mean we change the behavior of requestNetwork on V+?",
      "parentUuid": "223e2a4a_11c76161",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "29ff998bb9ba3a3e380078bf9d789e750748d03f",
